Mark Start State as Visited

WHILE Queue is not Empty

    Remove State and Path from Queue

    IF State = Goal State
        RETURN Path
    END IF

    FOR each Peg A, B, C

        IF Peg is not Empty

            Select Top Disk

            FOR each Other Peg

                IF Move is Valid

                    Create New State
                    Move Disk to Other Peg

                    IF New State is not Visited

                        Mark New State as Visited

                        Add (New State, Path + Move) to Queue

                    END IF
                END IF
            END FOR
        END IF
    END FOR
END WHILE
